<p>Create a gravity field around you that converts <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5%, 17%, 24%, 30%, 34%</acronym> of all damage you deal into physical damage, slows incoming projectiles by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3%, 20%, 30%, 38%, 43%,</acronym> and causes your gravity damage to reduce the target's knockback resistance by half for two turns.</p>